{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:39 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日（10月1日）早上11時54分，啟德世運道20號簡約公屋一名男子懷疑墮樓，倒臥在3座對開空地。救護車到場，發現事主昏迷不醒，連忙將他送往廣華醫院搶救，惜終告不治。警方正調查事件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6934306d71a1cbf712f0089c44eecd82/2026-10/2.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d4bbb70c2297583a808dab1650062ca5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_44_49_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/18fb684d50a939844a9be33597bd754b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_44_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是啟德世運道20號簡約公屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f5ab3ba8b0fab71d0d01c39537f1a5da/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_44_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1c96bd97924d82459e7a8335e54a8e71/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_44_48.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地面遺下一隻鞋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/aaa5b1d676cc89c72c649d3b493aa367/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_43_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c77a422f9e3b094f44d89874ad78d147/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_42_45_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/caecd5e8cded09e06c2e22672748f529/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-01_at_12_42_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T05:58:19.967854+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}